00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:24,040
Why are you so fixated on shooting from outside the box?

8
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,700
Hyuga-san.

9
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:30,090
I'll be frank. The football you played today was not Meiwa football.

10
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,420
