11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:35,060
Meiwa football is a football based on winning no matter what.

12
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:39,800
Yet today's Hyuga-san just kept shooting from outside the penalty area.

13
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,100
It definitely wasn't Meiwa football!

14
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,980
Hyuga-san!

15
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,770
Takeshi...

16
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,880
You're right.

17
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:57,150
Frankly, this match determines whether I get into Toho Academy or not.

18
00:00:57,150 --> 00:01:01,280
But at that time, they also said they were watching Ozora Tsubasa.

19
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:05,440
So, to prove I'm better than Tsubasa...

20
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:08,870
...I kept shooting from outside the penalty area.

21
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:12,060
But that was a mistake.

22
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:14,860
I realized it when Takeshi said it.

23
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:16,130
Hyuga-san...

24
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:21,070
In the second half, I'll score against Wakabayashi at all costs!

25
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:23,850
This is Meiwa's winning-based football!

26
00:01:23,850 --> 00:01:26,270
We'll definitely turn this around!

27
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:27,560
Hyuga-san!

28
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,500
Exactly!

29
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,020
Let's do this, Hyuga-san!

30
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:35,230
The halftime break is over, and the players of both teams have come out onto the field.

31
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:37,800
Only 20 minutes left.

32
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,610
Mom! Hurry up!

33
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:40,530
Nankatsu leads by one goal.

34
00:01:39,610 --> 00:01:40,530
Okay, okay.

35
00:01:40,530 --> 00:01:44,410
Can they keep this up and capture the purple championship pennant?

36
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:49,210
Or will Meiwa turn things around in the second half and become champions?

