The second half will start with Nankatsu's kick-off.

63
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:28,050
Episode 24:
Patience, Absolute Patience

64
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:28,050
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

65
00:03:28,350 --> 00:03:29,720
Alright!

66
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:34,060
Let's show Meiwa's true football in the second half!

67
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,560
Yes!

68
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:39,200
Go! Meiwa's lightning sliding tackle!

69
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:47,780
As soon as the game resumes, Meiwa's players swarm over Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun!

70
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:55,790
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun barely dodge them!

71
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:57,380
Alright! Come on, Meiwa!

72
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:59,040
That's it!

73
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,510
Tsubasa...

74
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:06,380
I don't care if you split them in two!

75
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,940
Just press them!

76
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:11,220
Faster! Dive where the ball is!

77
00:04:14,810 --> 00:04:18,560
The players slide, use their hands to turn, and slide again!

78
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:21,030
What an amazing way to tackle!

79
00:04:21,030 --> 00:04:23,860
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun can't budge!

80
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,330
Different...

81
00:04:28,590 --> 00:04:31,620
Meiwa's movements are completely different from the first half!

82
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:32,710
Take it!

83
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,700
Tsubasa-kun!

84
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:38,080
The ball comes to Tsubasa-kun once again!

85
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,860
But they are quickly closing in on him!

86
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,220
What will Tsubasa-kun do?!

87
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:49,730
Tsubasa-kun jumps to avoid the tackle!

88
00:04:49,730 --> 00:04:51,100
Nice jump!

89
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,100
Watch out, Tsubasa-kun!

90
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:56,600
Hyuga-kun steals the ball in mid-air!

91
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,270
What?!

92
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:58,150
Captain!

93
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,680
It's our turn this time!

94
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,610
Alright! Follow the Captain!

95
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:07,030
You look very ambitious in this second half, Meiwa.

96
00:05:07,030 --> 00:05:09,860
Hyuga-kun advances towards the Nankatsu goal.

97
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:13,120
In the second half, Meiwa is very different from before!

98
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,500
We'll stop them right here!

99
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,200
Yes!

100
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:20,960
To stop Hyuga-kun's famous dribble, the Nankatsu defense steps forward!

101
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,550
I'm counting on you, Takeshi.

102
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:23,760
What?!

103
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:26,050
Hyuga-kun makes a back pass!

104
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:27,970
The ball goes to Sawada-kun.

105
00:05:27,970 --> 00:05:29,060
Different.

106
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:31,790
Hyuga-kun is very different from the first half.

107
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:33,040
Let's go!

108
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:37,180
And advancing, he enters Nankatsu's penalty area!

109
00:05:37,180 --> 00:05:38,440
Hyuga-kun!

110
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,870
If the ball reaches Hyuga, a dangerous situation will arise!

111
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:42,940
Defense, mark Sawada!

112
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:44,820
I won't let you take it!

113
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:50,570
I can't waste Hyuga-san's trust in passing to me, or everyone's efforts.

114
00:05:50,570 --> 00:05:54,790
I will pass this ball to Hyuga-san.

115
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,330
There!

116
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:02,580
Sawada Takeshi-kun...

117
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:07,470
...makes a wonderful cross through a tiny gap in the Nankatsu defense!

118
00:06:07,470 --> 00:06:08,300
Takeshi!

119
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:12,050
Hyuga-kun takes a direct shot from inside the penalty area!

120
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:24,230
However, Wakabayashi-kun blocks by putting his entire body in front of the ball!

121
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:26,460
This time it's different!

122
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:29,490
I shot before you!

123
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:34,490
This time Wakabayashi-kun is blown away!

124
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,200
Wakabayashi-kun!

125
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,960
It's heading for the goal!

126
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:43,210
We did it!

127
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:48,750
No, this...

128
00:06:48,750 --> 00:06:51,130
Meiwa is thwarted again.

129
00:06:51,130 --> 00:06:53,130
Even though his whole body is inside the goal...

130
00:06:53,130 --> 00:06:57,620
...Wakabayashi-kun manages to stop the ball on the goal line!

131
00:06:57,620 --> 00:07:00,430
Nice, Wakabayashi-san!

132
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:04,020
Hyuga-san couldn't score even from inside the penalty area...

133
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:08,020
Wakabayashi-kun's defense is as perfect as in the first half.

134
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:12,320
However, Meiwa's enthusiasm seems very different compared to the first half.

135
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:14,180
Damn it!

136
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:16,370
Why did you catch it?!

137
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:18,770
My big brother finally shot!

138
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:19,910
Bastard!

139
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:23,380
Mom, Takeru, Naoko, Masaru...

140
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:24,690
What's up, Kojiro?!

141
00:07:24,690 --> 00:07:26,750
Score a goal quickly!

142
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:30,420
Otherwise, we'll have come all the way from Saitama for nothing!

143
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:33,370
No matter what they say, victory depends on your feet!

144
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:35,540
Turn this situation around somehow!

145
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:37,140
Yes!

146
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:43,060
Kojiro! Kojiro! Kojiro! Kojiro!

147
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:41,020
Why is everyone here?

148
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,060
Kojiro...

149
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,560
Everyone, I'm counting on you for one more goal!

150
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:46,940
Take it!

151
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,440
Wakabayashi...

152
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:52,950
This time I will definitely score.

153
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:54,450
Take it, Tsubasa!

154
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:57,660
Nankatsu immediately delivers the ball to Tsubasa-kun.

155
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:58,720
Alright! Go, Tsubasa!

156
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:02,710
Even though he's in midfield, Tsubasa-kun is also a playmaker.

157
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:06,210
Even though his body is small, he's Nankatsu's star player.

158
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,920
Is your leg okay, Genzo?

159
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:12,820
Even though you were allowed to play for one match...

160
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:18,100
...you stopped Hyuga's powerful shots in the first half.

161
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:22,570
Such effort is more tiring than a normal match.

162
00:08:22,570 --> 00:08:24,730
Takasugi! Move up a little more!

163
00:08:28,090 --> 00:08:34,360
Wakabayashi-kun stopped Sawada-kun's shot with his injured left leg at the end of the first half.

164
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,870
We can't burden him any further.

165
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:40,220
For Wakabayashi-kun's sake, let's score one more goal, Misaki-kun!

166
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:40,990
Yes!

167
00:08:40,990 --> 00:08:42,500
As if we'd allow it!

168
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,620
There!

169
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:44,320
What?!

170
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,290
Tsubasa-kun sends a long pass to Izawa-kun.

171
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:48,790
They go right and left.

172
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:52,170
Now Meiwa won't be able to slide tackle.

173
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:54,040
Alright! That's it!

174
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:58,430
It's better if Misaki and Tsubasa don't play side by side!

175
00:08:58,430 --> 00:08:59,860
Everyone, I'm begging you!

176
00:08:59,860 --> 00:09:01,970
Protect the goal at all costs!

177
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:03,930
Then pass it to me!

178
00:09:03,930 --> 00:09:07,190
This time, I will definitely... Definitely score a goal!

179
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:08,310
Captain!

180
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:09,310
Hyuga...

181
00:09:09,310 --> 00:09:11,270
Kojiro...

182
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,910
Alright! We'll protect it!

183
00:09:12,910 --> 00:09:14,520
Gather around the goal!

184
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,700
We'll protect it at all costs!

185
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,700
We'll definitely send the ball to the Captain!

186
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:23,700
Will Nankatsu be able to break through Meiwa, who put everything on defense?

187
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:29,460
Meiwa quickly intervenes and steals the ball!

188
00:09:29,460 --> 00:09:32,430
Misaki-kun takes it right back!

189
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:35,260
He's playing well as usual.

190
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:38,550
He can be called Nankatsu's other star player!

191
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,150
Misaki-kun, send it up!

192
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:41,930
Send it to the right of the goal!

193
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:47,350
Tsubasa-kun runs towards the goal while directing Misaki-kun!

194
00:09:47,350 --> 00:09:48,490
They're planning something...

195
00:09:48,490 --> 00:09:51,440
I can't let Misaki-san cross!

196
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:56,110
Misaki-kun towards the goal...

197
00:09:56,110 --> 00:09:59,860
Ah! Sawada-kun from Meiwa slides in!

198
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:03,750
They collide!

199
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:06,410
But Misaki-kun sends the cross a second earlier!

200
00:10:07,730 --> 00:10:08,710
Misaki-san!

201
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:10,750
Tsubasa-kun!

202
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:15,190
The ball is sent towards the Meiwa goal.

203
00:10:15,190 --> 00:10:17,470
Alright! Leave this to me!

204
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,470
What is he thinking?!

205
00:10:20,470 --> 00:10:23,600
Tsubasa-kun runs towards the goal post!

206
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,930
Oh no! Was he after this?!

207
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:30,340
Wakashimazu-kun also runs towards the other goal post!

208
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:31,940
I have to catch up...

209
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,690
Th-This...

210
00:10:33,690 --> 00:10:35,940
...is the move we used in our match!

211
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:40,670
He rises towards the sky using the goal post...

212
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:42,920
...and shoots from the highest point.

213
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:46,540
This is the Tachibana Brothers' special acrobatic football from Hanawa!

214
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:47,750
But...

215
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:53,710
...Wakashimazu-kun also jumps using the triple kick!

216
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:58,340
A huge aerial battle between Tsubasa-kun and Wakashimazu-kun!

217
00:11:01,710 --> 00:11:04,620
Wakashimazu-kun stops it!

218
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,770
I kept my promise, Captain!

219
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:16,480
Now it's your turn to score!

220
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,310
Everyone, fall back!

221
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:20,940
Tsubasa!

222
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,010
Misaki!

223
00:11:23,010 --> 00:11:27,880
Nankatsu's two star players, Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun, are lying on the ground in Meiwa's half!

224
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:29,980
Both star players are down!

225
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:29,980
- Taro...
- Tsubasa!

226
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:32,080
Nankatsu is in a very difficult situation!

227
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,500
The ball goes to Hyuga-kun.

228
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:36,290
Everyone, don't panic!

229
00:11:36,290 --> 00:11:38,180
First, mark Hyuga!

230
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:40,300
We have to protect this place no matter what!

231
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:41,420
Yes!

232
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:42,840
Wakabayashi...

233
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:46,680
I have never desired to score this much in my entire life!

234
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:48,800
Everyone, let's support the Captain!

235
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,180
Yes!

236
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,690
Misaki-san...

237
00:11:58,660 --> 00:12:00,940
I always thought I was alone.

238
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:04,780
I considered everyone around me an enemy.

239
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:08,740
Damn it! We have to stop him!

240
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:14,170
But it turns out I had friends by my side.

241
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:15,920
What is he thinking?

242
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,980
Damn it! In that case--

243
00:12:18,530 --> 00:12:19,170
What?!

244
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,540
Kojiro!

245
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:24,530
We thought Hyuga-kun would dribble through, but...

246
00:12:24,530 --> 00:12:27,050
...he passed to the wing.

247
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:30,510
Alright! Let's go!

248
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,390
Don't lose the ball to Nankatsu!

249
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:35,550
Let's deliver the final pass to the Captain!

250
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:38,880
That's it! A very fast attack!

251
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:41,690
Coach Kira, who has coached us up to now...

252
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:45,450
Everyone who came to support us up to now...

253
00:12:46,450 --> 00:12:48,910
Prevent the pass to Hyuga no matter what!

254
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:51,240
I will stop it no matter what!

255
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,040
Over here, Ishi-san!

256
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,910
A wonderful move from Sawada-kun.

257
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:58,040
He goes behind the defense and receives Ishi-kun's pass!

258
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:58,810
Oh no!

259
00:12:58,810 --> 00:13:00,420
I'm counting on you, Takeshi!

260
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,000
Exactly, Takeshi.

